                17.20. Winning Margin</h3>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                Select the margin by which the specified team wins the match including overtime if offered. Four different ranges are possible.</p>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                1. Possible selections (15 points): Home Team Over x.5 points, Away Team Over x.5 points, Either Less Than x.5 points</p>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                2. Possible selections (25 points): Home Team with 1-24 points, Home Team with 25+ points, Away Team with 1-24 points, Away Team with 25+ points. Draw</p>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                3. Possible selections (40 points): Home Team with 1-39 points, Home Team with 40+ points, Away Team with 1-39 points, Away Team with 40+ points. Draw</p>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                4. Possible selections: Home Team with 1-12 points, Home Team with 13-24 points, Home Team with 25-36 points, Home Team with 37-48 points, Home Team with 49-60 points, Home Team with 61-72 points, Home Team with 73+ points, Away Team with 1-12 points, Away Team with 13-24 points, Away Team with 25-36 points, Away Team with 37-48 points, Away Team with 49-60 points, Away Team with 61-72 points, Away Team with 73+ points, Draw</p>
              <h3 class="Headings__head--2LV Headings__bold--iD3 Headings__h3--16M Headings__dark--1eH" style="color: rgb(251, 37, 141);">
