                32.8. To Win The Rest Of The Match</h3>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                Select the winner of the period from the time the bet was placed until the end of the match. For this market, teams are starting with the virtual score of 0:0. The score listed in brackets, e.g. (score 3:2) is the current match score. Only goals scored after bet placement will count. Any goals scored prior to the time of bet placement do not count for the purpose of this wager.</p>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
