              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                Select the total number of goals scored in overtime to be over (more than) or under (less than) the given value. Goals scored in the regular match time do not count. If a whole number is offered as the given value and the total score is equal to this value, bets will be void. The score of both teams will be combined. Only goals scored within the overtime will count.</p>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                Possible selections: Over x.5 goals, Under x.5 goals.</p>
