                Select the total number of goals scored in the first half to be over (more than) or under (less than) the given goals value. If a whole number is offered as the given goals value and the total score is equal to this value, bets will be void. The goals of both teams will be combined.</p>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                Possible selections: Over x.5 goals, Under x.5 goals.</p>
              <h3 class="Headings__head--2LV Headings__bold--iD3 Headings__h3--16M Headings__dark--1eH" style="color: rgb(251, 37, 141);">
                33.27. 1<sup>st</sup> Half Total Goals Home Team</h3>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                Select the total number of goals scored by the home team in the first half to be over (more than) or under (less than) the given goals value. If a whole number is offered as the given goals value and the total score is equal to this value, bets will be void.</p>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                Possible selections: Over x.5 goals, Under x.5 goals.</p>
              <h3 class="Headings__head--2LV Headings__bold--iD3 Headings__h3--16M Headings__dark--1eH" style="color: rgb(251, 37, 141);">
                33.28. 1<sup>st</sup> Half Total Goals Away Team</h3>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                Select the total number of goals scored by the away team in the first half to be over (more than) or under (less than) the given goals value. If a whole number is offered as the given goals value and the total score is equal to this value, bets will be void.</p>
              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                Possible selections: Over x.5 goals, Under x.5 goals.</p>
              <h3 class="Headings__head--2LV Headings__bold--iD3 Headings__h3--16M Headings__dark--1eH" style="color: rgb(251, 37, 141);">
