              <p class="PlainText__text--1wg PlainText__medium--1_S PlainText__dark--3fd">
                If an event is postponed and will start at the same venue within the next two (2) days, all bets on this event stand. If it is postponed and takes place at another venue, all bets on this event are void.</p>
